    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani yoombakha inzu yOMWAMI",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muinuyika kwebikhumi bine namakhumi munaane inyuma wokhurula khwabaIsiraeli muMisiri, mumuyika kwakhane kwoburuchi bwaSulemani muIsiraeli, mumwesi kwaZibu, nikwo omwesi kwakhabili, yachaaka okhuumbakha inzu yOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne inzu eyo eya omuruchi Sulemani yamuumbashila OMWAMI, oburambi bwayo bwali amakhono amakhumi kasasaba, nobuchiikha amakhono amakhumi kabili, nobuchinguukhu amakhono amakhumi kataru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshirookoola eshiali imbeli wobwelu bweinzu, oburambi bwashio bwali amakhono amakhumi kabili, obuchiikha bweinzu yeene shinga olwa bwali, nobuchiikha bwashio amakhono ekhumi imbeli weinzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munzu omwo yakhola amatirisha akeesunduukha mwisiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwisiisi lieinzu yoombakha omuumbakho kundi okuchibotokhana khwisiisi lieinzu tsimbeka tsiosi, eliahabwelu bwene nende habundu ahatakatifu ahomukari; khandi yakhola ebisika bielubeka, tsimbeka tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwelu bwahasi bwali amakhono karaano obuchiikha bwabwo, obwahakari bwali amakhono kasasaba obuchiikha, nobwakhataru amakhono musaafu obuchiikha; okhuba elwanyi yali nakholile tsinungo khwisiisi lieinzu tsimbeka tsiosi, mbu emisaala chileshe okhwinjisibwa mwisiisi lieinzu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa inzu yali niyumbakhungwa, yoombashiiwa amachina akabaatsilwa pe aha kayabungwa; kata obuyoka bweinyoli kata obweihaywa kata obweshikholelo shindi shiosi shieshibia shibwahuliilishila munzu olwa yoombakhungwa ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuliango kwobwelu bwahasi kwali elubeka lwasautsi weinzu; mana nibaniinilanga khumaniinilo akeeborola okhuula khubwelu bwahakari, nokhurula khubwahakari okhuula khubwakhataru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindio yoombakha inzu nachimalilisiai nakuula nende okhufwimbakhwo, emikuulo nende tsimbaho tsiemisiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoombakha omuumbakho okwo okwabotokhana inzu yosi, buli bwelu nibuchinguukha amakhono karaano; nibuungasibwa khunzu netsimbaho tsiemisiita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa liOMWAMI nilimwitsila Sulemani liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumakhuwa keinzu yino eya wumbakhanga, noba nolachenda muka ndalachilisia, niwusia akobukhalachi bwanje, nolinda amalako kanje kosi nochenda muko; kho ndalaralisia likhuwa lianje ninawe, elia ndasunjila Daudi so. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalamenyanga hakari wabaana baIsiraeli, kata shindalalekha abandu banje Isiraeli ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindio Sulemani yoombakha inzu nachimalilisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoombashila lisiisi lieinzu mukari tsimbaho tsiemisiita; okhurula khubwelu okhuula khumikuulo chieshilama, yalifuunishila tsimbaho munzu mukari; khandi nafuunikha obwelu bweinzu tsimbaho tsiemitaraakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana munzu emukulu yakhalakamwo eshitonye shiamakhono amakhumi kabili, eshietsimbaho tsiemisiita okhurula khubwelu okhuula khutsinyanzo; yoombakha ario munzu mukari, okhuba eshisika shiomukari, habundu ahashila obutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo inzu, eshisina mbu habwelu, ahali imbeli weshisika eshiomukari, yali amakhono amakhumi kane oburambi bwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsimbaho tsiemisiita etsiali munzu mukari tsiabaatswa ebimuka nende ebimuli ebibambuukhu; yosi yali yemisiita; amachina shikalolekha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yakasia eshisika eshiomukari, munzu mukari, okhuramwo lisanduku lieindakano yOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mushisika tsana mukari mwachelwa oburambi amakhono amakhumi kabili, nobuchiikha amakhono amakhumi kabili, nobuchinguukhu amakhono amakhumi kabili; nafuumakhwo itsahaabu inzeleleshe; nakhola nende eshimalilo shiemisiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani nafuuma inzu mukari mwayo itsahaabu inzeleleshe; nakhwesa obunyolo bweitsahaabu imbeli weshisika tsana shiomukari, nashifuumakhwo itsahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzu eyo yosi yafuumakhwo itsahaabu, okhuula olwa inzu yosi yali niyihweele; neshimalilo shiosi nashio, eshiali shieshisika shiomukari, yashifuumakhwo itsahaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mushisika tsana shiomukari, yakhola abakerubi babili ababaatswa omusaala kwomutseituni, buli mulala oburambibwe amakhono ekhumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olubaha lulala Iwomukerubi lwachelwa amakhono karaano, nolubaha lundi Iwomukerubi amakhono karaano; okhurula khubutsunzu bwolubaha lulala okhuula khubutsunzu bwolundi namakhono ekhumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi omukerubi undi yosi yali amakhono ekhumi; abakerubi bombi bali abeshichelo shilala nokhufwana khulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburambi bwomukerubi mulala bwali amakhono ekhumi, nobwomukerubi undi nabwo bwali burio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yara abakerubi tsana mushitonye shieinzu eshiomukari bwene. Tsimbaha tsiabakerubi tsiali nitsibambuushe, ne olubaha lwamulala Iwoola khwisiisi elubeka, nolubaha Iwomukerubi undi Iwoola khwisiisi elubeka lundi; mana tsimbaha tsiabwe tsindi nitsibukaanila hakari weinzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
