          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mumuyika kwekhumi nalulala, mumwesi kwaBuli, nikwo omwesi kwomunaane, inzu yahwa, ebitonye biayo biosi, omufwano okwakasibwa kwosi shinga olwa kwali. Yamala ario emiyika musaafu nachiumbakhanga.",
          "type": "text",
